CHAPTER.VERS:
John to the seven churches that are in Asia: Grace to you

          {+}
         and peace, from Him Who Is and Who Was and Who Is To Come; and from the seven Spirits who are before his throne;

I John, your

          {+}
         brother and copartner with you

          {+}
         in the tribulation and kingdom and patience [which are] in Jesus, was in the isle that is called Patmos, for the word of God and the testimony of Jesus.
